		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Here. In the present. Now. Here.<br />
Thank you Irene for being a rock solid mom.<br />
I have been blessed to have come to know &amp; love your babes.<br />
I am nourished by the raw oysters we ate in the sound.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
